&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over 300 employees across 12 countries, wrangling our People data into well-architected systems for smooth administration and analysis is challenging. We are looking for someone who is capable of building and maintaining systems and contributing to the execution of processes within those tools, such as onboarding and offboarding. The ideal candidate is a certified Workday Pro who thinks in first principles when configuring our tools and workflows. It is paramount that the Senior People Systems Analyst builds for both today and tomorrow, ensuring our solutions endure our growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
