&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal configurator of all Workday modules, reports, and business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoughtfully architect our HR data across all places where it exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the administration of review cycles within and outside of Workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage HR-related integrations in collaboration with IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as our employee’s point of contact for HR systems questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain various security roles and permissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams to build reporting and tools that leverage HR data outside of our HR systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the entry and management of employee data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
